en January and May, 1991, the complainant remitted a sum of DM 98,000 which the 1st respondent encashed. This amount was approximately Rs. 2,500,000. Those monies were admittedly handed over to the 2nd respondent by the 1st respondent. The first land was sold by the owner to Indralal Perera for a sum of Rs, 320,
