d. On 29. 12. 1981 the plaintiff instituted action against the defendants claiming that he was the tenant in occupation of the premises and that the defendants at the instigation of the second highest bidder for the tavern for 1982 were making arrangements to disturb the plaintiffs possession. The plaintiff prayed for a declaration that he is entitled to the undisturbed and uninte
