 should be considered, if at all, at the stage of execution in terms of section 52 of the Law. 265 Per S. N. Silva, CJ. "In this instance the claims of the 4th defendant on the Indenture of Lease and compensation for improvements, have been validly brought within the partition action. But, the 4th defendant should not have been permitted to add another string to his bow by raisin
