e concerned it would not prevent the new single house owner landlord from ejecting the tenant by depositing five years rent subject to such notices, etc, being given. In other words the prohibition in section 22 (7) would not apply where there was no nexus in respect of ownership between the previous landlord and the present landlord. It is the single house ownership tha
