e law as amended by Act, No.17of1997. (2) The proceedings of the District Court leading up to the trial and interlocutory decree were bad and should be set aside. APPEAL from the judgment of the Court of Appeal. Case referred to: 1. Somawathie v Madawala (1983) 2 SRI LR 15 Manohara de Silva for 2nd plaintiff-appellant. The petitioners respondents and 3-8 plaintiff-re

